  "details": "It's hard to believe, but I don't have enough 256 slots to save worlds. Hey! I'm a member of the Fun World Tour group. We are basically exploring all the amazing worlds in the VRC. And 4 tabs and 256 slots is.. not enough for me. Very lacking in subsections, only 4 tabs, and if you allocate one for example to my friends worlds which are not many but it immediately closes off the use of ~50 slots for me because of that. Better classification and less restrictions on the number, that's what I'd like. This is a very unpopular request, I think, but I hope you'll pay attention. You can use this as another paid subscription feature, and it can be done very quickly with minimal risk. Thanks for your consideration, I hope I'm not the only one in this world.\nP.S. Don't make me make a world with a thousand portals and pictures inside. Or remove good worlds from \"favorites\" worlds because I don't have enough slots.. Please..",
